Third-party notice

This project is an independent, clean-room re-implementation. It contains no
code from Keil MDK / µVision, ARM Compiler, UVSC.dll or any other vendor
binary. It drives those programs through their documented and observed
interfaces when they are installed.

Data snapshots under data/fixtures/ are derived artefacts produced on a
machine where MDK was installed:

  * data/fixtures/cdb/uv4_cdb.xml      UVCDB2XML dump of UV4.cdb (device names,
                                       core/family, startup/system file paths,
                                       vendor ids, descriptions)
  * data/fixtures/Packs/**/*.pdsc      CMSIS-Pack descriptions (ARM.CMSIS,
                                       Keil.STM32F1xx_DFP, Keil.STM32NUCLEO_BSP)
  * data/fixtures/UV4/**               µVision property/SVCS/XSD text resources
  * data/fixtures/tools/**             ARM toolchain version metadata
  * data/fixtures/catalog/**           module catalogue reconstructed from PE
                                       headers, export tables and strings

Those files remain the property of their respective owners and are included
only as factual metadata needed for interoperability. If you redistribute this
package commercially, review the corresponding vendor licences (in particular
the ARM CMSIS-Pack licence terms that ship inside each .pdsc) first.
